  "details": "I create birthday party versions of my EvolvedAnt Arcade world for people.\nThis involves me customizing the world, uploading it (on my own account), and then giving the customer the world ID.\nThey then use a site such as: https://thegreatpug.com/vrchat-link-generator/#\nThis enables them to generate  a friends+ link to the world.\nHowever, this is now broken, they receive an error when attempting to launch the world through the generated link.\nSTEPS TO REPRODUCE:\nGo to the great pug link generator site: https://thegreatpug.com/vrchat-link-generator/#\nPaste in the world id: wrld_af2c5f7c-8525-485e-a1dd-75fdb32a5658\nLog into the VRChat website to get your internal User ID from the URL bar to paste in as the instance owner.\nSet the instance to Friends+\nClick Generate.\nClick 'Launch', to launch the game into the world.\nYou will get an error.\nI've had multiple users test, and they all get the error. Only if I do it myself, does it work, presumably because I am the owner of the world, however this isn't helpful for those who need to host a birthday party.",
